'''Forgotten Graves''' (忘らるる墓所 ''Wasuraruru Bosho'', '''Forgotten Graveyard''') is the 29th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 78th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.10 Update|version 9.10]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter features a large amount and variety of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies, so its difficulty depends on what units the player owns. A fairly difficult sub-chapter overall.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Zollow]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Brollow]]. It has lower health, attack power and speed, but the ability to [[Revive|revive]], [[Omni Strike]] with 122 piercing range, and a guaranteed chance for a [[Toxic]] attack which removes 80% of the target's HP.

